@TITLE Colossal Cave
@AUTHOR Adapted from Crowther & Woods
@START road
@DESC_TEXT Classic cave exploration adventure.

@ROOM road
@DESC
You are standing at the end of a road
before a small brick building. Around
you is a forest. A small stream flows
out of the building and down a gully.
@ENDDESC
@CHOICE "Enter the building" -> building
@CHOICE "Walk down the gully" -> valley
@CHOICE "Enter the forest" -> forest

@ROOM building
@DESC
You are inside a well house for a large
spring. There are some keys here, and a
lamp on a shelf. A note reads: "MAGIC
WORD: XYZZY"
@ENDDESC
@ITEM keys "Set of Keys" "Brass keys on a worn leather ring."
@ITEM lamp "Brass Lamp" "A battered but sturdy oil lamp. It has plenty of fuel."
@ON_ENTER @SET know_xyzzy
@CHOICE "Take supplies and go outside" -> road
@CHOICE "Say XYZZY" -> debris_room @NEED know_xyzzy
@SCORE +5

@ROOM forest
@DESC
You are in a dense forest. The trees are
too thick to see far. You hear birds and
the distant sound of water. All paths
seem to lead back to the road.
@ENDDESC
@CHOICE "Go back to the road" -> road

@ROOM valley
@DESC
You are in a shallow valley with a stream
running through it. The stream disappears
into a slit in the rock at the base of
a cliff. A grate is set into the ground.
@ENDDESC
@CHOICE "Open the grate" -> below_grate @NEED keys
@CHOICE "Follow the stream" -> slit
@CHOICE "Go back to the road" -> road

@ROOM slit
@DESC
At the base of the cliff, the stream
flows through a 2-inch slit in the rock.
You cannot fit through, but you hear
echoes of a vast space beyond.
@ENDDESC
@CHOICE "Go back" -> valley

@ROOM below_grate
@DESC
You are in a small chamber beneath a
steel grate which casts bars of light
on the floor. A low crawl leads west.
@ENDDESC
@ON_ENTER @SET entered_cave
@SCORE +10
@CHOICE "Crawl west" -> cobble_crawl @NEED lamp
@CHOICE "Go back up" -> valley
@CHOICE "Try crawling in the dark" -> dark_fall @NEED !lamp

@ROOM dark_fall
@DESC
You stumble in the pitch darkness and
fall into a pit. You should have brought
a light.
@ENDDESC
@GAMEOVER "It is pitch dark. You fell into a pit."

@ROOM cobble_crawl
@DESC
You are crawling over cobbles in a low
passage. There is a dim light at the
east end of the passage. The passage
opens up to the west.
@ENDDESC
@CHOICE "Go west" -> debris_room
@CHOICE "Go back east" -> below_grate

@ROOM debris_room
@DESC
You are in a debris room filled with
stuff washed in from the surface. A low
wide passage goes east, and a canyon
leads north. A note says "MAGIC WORD:
XYZZY".
@ENDDESC
@ITEM food "Tasty Food" "Emergency rations: dried meat, biscuits, and chocolate."
@CHOICE "Go east" -> cobble_crawl
@CHOICE "Go north" -> awk_canyon
@CHOICE "Say XYZZY" -> building @NEED know_xyzzy
@SCORE +5

@ROOM awk_canyon
@DESC
You are in an awkward sloping east/west
canyon. A note on the wall says "MAGIC
WORD: PLUGH".
@ENDDESC
@ON_ENTER @SET know_plugh
@CHOICE "Go east (up)" -> bird_chamber
@CHOICE "Go west (down)" -> debris_room

@ROOM bird_chamber
@DESC
You are in a splendid chamber thirty
feet high. The walls are covered with
cave formations. A cheerful little bird
is singing in a cage near the passage.
@ENDDESC
@ITEM bird "Caged Bird" "A small songbird with brilliant blue and gold plumage."
@CHOICE "Go south" -> awk_canyon
@CHOICE "Go west" -> pit_top

@ROOM pit_top
@DESC
You are at the top of a small pit
breathing traces of white mist. A rough
stone stairway leads down into the pit.
East is a passageway. There is a large
"DANGER" sign posted nearby.
@ENDDESC
@CHOICE "Go down" -> hall_of_mists
@CHOICE "Go east" -> bird_chamber

@ROOM hall_of_mists
@DESC
You are at one end of a vast hall
stretching forward out of sight. The
hall is filled with wisps of white mist
swaying to and fro. Rough-hewn stone
steps lead up to a dome.
@ENDDESC
@SCORE +15
@CHOICE "Go south" -> nugget_room
@CHOICE "Go east" -> fissure
@CHOICE "Go up" -> pit_top
@CHOICE "Say PLUGH" -> building @NEED know_plugh

@ROOM nugget_room
@DESC
This is a low room with a crude note
on the wall. It says: "You won't get
it up the steps." In the center of the
room lies a large sparkling gold nugget!
@ENDDESC
@ITEM gold_nugget "Gold Nugget" "A fist-sized chunk of pure gold, surprisingly heavy."
@SCORE +20
@CHOICE "Go north" -> hall_of_mists

@ROOM fissure
@DESC
You are on the east bank of a fissure
which splits the hall. The mist is quite
thick here, obscuring all detail. A
narrow crystal bridge spans the gap.
@IF diamond
The bridge shimmers more brightly as
you approach with the diamond.
@ENDIF
@ENDDESC
@CHOICE "Cross the bridge" -> west_fissure
@CHOICE "Go west" -> hall_of_mists

@ROOM west_fissure
@DESC
You are on the west side of the fissure.
A low wide passage goes west. Rough
stone steps lead down into the darkness.
@ENDDESC
@CHOICE "Go west" -> west_hall
@CHOICE "Go down" -> deep_cave
@CHOICE "Cross back" -> fissure

@ROOM west_hall
@DESC
You are at the west end of the hall of
mists. A low passage continues west
and another goes north. The mists thin
here and you can see further.
@ENDDESC
@CHOICE "Go north" -> long_hall
@CHOICE "Go south" -> west_fissure

@ROOM long_hall
@DESC
You are in a long hall with a rounded
ceiling. Several rough passages lead
off in various directions.
@ENDDESC
@CHOICE "Go east" -> crossover
@CHOICE "Go south" -> west_hall

@ROOM crossover
@DESC
You are at a crossover of a high north/
south passage and a low east/west one.
@ENDDESC
@CHOICE "Go north" -> dead_end_diamonds
@CHOICE "Go south" -> long_hall
@CHOICE "Go east" -> swiss_cheese

@ROOM dead_end_diamonds
@DESC
You have reached a dead end. There is a
large collection of diamonds scattered
on the floor, glittering in the lamplight
like a thousand tiny stars.
@ENDDESC
@ITEM diamond "Diamonds" "A handful of brilliant cut diamonds. Worth a fortune."
@SCORE +25
@CHOICE "Go south" -> crossover

@ROOM swiss_cheese
@DESC
You are in a room whose walls resemble
Swiss cheese. Passages lead in many
directions, most too small to follow.
One wider passage leads east.
@ENDDESC
@CHOICE "Go east" -> troll_bridge
@CHOICE "Go west" -> crossover

@ROOM troll_bridge
@DESC
You are at one end of a narrow bridge
spanning a bottomless chasm. A massive
troll blocks the way across. He demands
payment to let you pass.
@ENDDESC
@CHOICE "Throw food to the troll" -> across_bridge @NEED food
@CHOICE "Try to fight the troll" -> troll_fight
@CHOICE "Go back" -> swiss_cheese

@ROOM troll_fight
@DESC
The troll swats you aside like a fly.
You land hard on the stone floor.
Violence is not the answer here.
@ENDDESC
@CHOICE "Try something else" -> troll_bridge

@ROOM across_bridge
@DESC
The troll catches the food, examines it,
grunts with satisfaction, and lumbers
away into the darkness. The bridge is
now clear.
@ENDDESC
@ON_ENTER @SET troll_fed
@SCORE +15
@CHOICE "Cross the bridge" -> treasure_hall @USE food

@ROOM deep_cave
@DESC
You are deep underground. The air is
stale and warm. Strange glowing fungi
cling to the walls, providing an eerie
green illumination. A passage leads
further down.
@ENDDESC
@CHOICE "Go deeper" -> dragon_lair
@CHOICE "Go back up" -> west_fissure

@ROOM dragon_lair
@DESC
A massive red dragon lies coiled around
an enormous pile of treasure. One yellow
eye opens as you approach. Smoke curls
from its nostrils.
@IF bird
The bird begins to sing a hauntingly
beautiful melody. The dragon closes
its eye and falls into a deep sleep.
@ENDIF
@ENDDESC
@CHOICE "Sing with the bird" -> dragon_sleep @NEED bird
@CHOICE "Try to sneak past" -> dragon_angry @NEED !bird
@CHOICE "Retreat" -> deep_cave

@ROOM dragon_angry
@DESC
The dragon opens its maw and a wall of
flame engulfs the passage. There is no
escape.
@ENDDESC
@GAMEOVER "The dragon's fire was inescapable. Perhaps a songbird could soothe the beast."

@ROOM dragon_sleep
@DESC
As the bird sings, the dragon's breathing
slows and deepens. It sleeps soundly now.
Among its hoard you spot an ornate golden
chalice encrusted with rubies.
@ENDDESC
@ITEM chalice "Golden Chalice" "A magnificent chalice of hammered gold set with rubies."
@ON_ENTER @SET dragon_asleep
@SCORE +30
@CHOICE "Go back carefully" -> deep_cave

@ROOM treasure_hall
@DESC
You emerge into a magnificent hall of
carved stone. Ancient stalactites hang
from the ceiling like chandeliers. The
walls are covered in primitive paintings
depicting great treasures.
@ENDDESC
@ITEM silver_bars "Silver Bars" "Three bars of pure silver, stamped with ancient runes."
@SCORE +20
@CHOICE "Go deeper" -> final_chamber
@CHOICE "Go back" -> across_bridge

@ROOM final_chamber
@DESC
You stand in the innermost chamber of
Colossal Cave. A natural skylight far
above lets in a shaft of sunlight. In
the center, a stone altar holds an
ancient crown.
@IF gold_nugget
@IF diamond
@IF chalice
The crown begins to glow as you approach
with the treasures. The cave hums with
ancient power.
@ENDIF
@ENDIF
@ENDIF
@ENDDESC
@ITEM crown "Ancient Crown" "A platinum crown set with a flawless star sapphire."
@CHOICE "Place treasures on the altar" -> victory @NEED gold_nugget @NEED diamond @NEED chalice
@CHOICE "Take the crown and leave" -> exit_cave
@SCORE +25

@ROOM exit_cave
@DESC
Clutching the crown, you retrace your
steps through the winding cave. The
bird sings as you emerge into the
sunlight at the well house.

You have explored Colossal Cave and
lived to tell the tale!
@ENDDESC
@SCORE +10
@WIN "You escaped with the crown! Score: {score}"

@ROOM victory
@DESC
You place the gold nugget, diamonds, and
chalice on the altar. The crown lifts
into the air, blazing with light. The
cave fills with a thunderous voice:

"WORTHY ADVENTURER! THE TREASURES ARE
YOURS. GO FORTH WITH MY BLESSING."

The ground trembles and a passage opens
leading directly to the surface.
@ENDDESC
@SCORE +50
@WIN "You conquered Colossal Cave with all treasures! Score: {score}"
